OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews spend night fighting
OL,4,Aderelict nightclub blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have spent the night at
OL,7,Fthe scene of a blaze in a derelict
OL,8,Fnightclub in Glasgow city centre.
OL,10,FThe alarm was raised at the former
OL,11,FJumpin' Jaks on Sauchiehall Street
OL,12,Fabout 01:36.
OL,14,FPolice Scotland said Dalhousie Street
OL,15,Fis closed, between Renfrew Street and
OL,16,FSauchiehall Street.
OL,18,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,19,F(SFRS) said it mobilised nine
OL,20,Fappliances, one height appliance and
OL,21,Fthree specialist resources to the
OL,22,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
